.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt SVCCTL 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm svcctl
.Nd control RavenBSD services
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm list
.Nm
.Cm status Ar name
.Nm
.Cm start Ar name
.Nm
.Cm stop Ar name
.Nm
.Cm restart Ar name
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility talks to
.Xr init 8
through the
.Dq svc:
control scheme.
Every command prints one line per service:
.D1 Ar name state restarts
where
.Ar state
is one of
.Dq stopped ,
.Dq starting ,
.Dq running ,
.Dq restarting ,
.Dq failed
or
.Dq gave-up ,
and
.Ar restarts
is the current restart count.
.Pp
The commands are:
.Bl -tag -width "restart"
.It Cm list
List every service.
.It Cm status Ar name
Print the current state of
.Ar name .
.It Cm start Ar name
Start a stopped service.
.It Cm stop Ar name
Stop supervising a running service.
There are no signals yet: the child keeps running until it exits by itself.
.It Cm restart Ar name
Stop supervising the service and start a fresh instance.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A successful command exits 0.
A usage error, an unknown service, a malformed status line or a failed control
request exits 1 with
.Dq svcctl: <name>: <message>
on standard error.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr init 8
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
